---
const costs = ['Support tickets','Onboarding calls','Implementation delays','Bad intake decisions','Poor qualification','Repeated internal explanations','Low adoption','Customer success workarounds','Churn or retention drag'];
---
<section id="cost-transfer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Cost Transfer</div>
    <h2>A guidance failure rarely stays inside the screen.</h2>
    <div class="chip-grid">{costs.map((cost) => <div class="cost-chip">{cost}</div>)}</div>
    <p class="section-copy cost-transfer-close">A Hidden Scaffold Review maps where the user stopped, what the product assumed, and which team is now paying for the missing guidance.</p>
  </div>
</section>
